(7449660, 1179093, 181814, '<td valign="top">Great idea! You captured the bird very well. I like the high key exposure on the rest of the photograph and this would definitely make for a good contest in the future. This is definitely one of my top picks in this contest.</td>', 'Great idea! You captured the bird very well. I like the high key exposure on the rest of the photograph and this would definitely make for a good contest in the future. This is definitely one of my top picks in this contest.', '2016-04-11 20:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
